      "typical_award_size": "HHAP-6 joint regional application for $1,826,480.60 (County $883,203.78 plus CoC $943,276.82), resolution adopted April 7, 2026, agreement through June 30, 2029; prior rounds: HHAP-1 $924,734.12 (CoC) and $856,699.99 (County), HHAP-2 $437,551 and $391,634, HHAP-3 $567,869.71 initial plus $1,703,609.13 remainder. HHAP-7 preliminary: County $811,781.46, CoC $869,765.85. Key Action 1 of the regional plan is to fully fund existing interim housing (Ford Street Project, Mendocino Coast Hospitality Center, Redwood Community Services, Project Sanctuary) through June 30, 2029; RFP 004-26 (due February 17, 2026) solicited shelter operators to obligate HHAP-6 and prior-round balances.",
